i</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Social smoking among U.S. college students</article-title><source>Pediatrics</source><year>2004</year><volume>114</volume><fpage>1028</fpage><lpage>1034</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15466101</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b13-ijerph-06-00036"><label>13.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Nichter</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Lloyd-Richardson</surname><given-names>EE</given-names></name><name><surname>Flaherty</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Carkoglu</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Taylor</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Gendered dimensions of smoking among college students</article-title><source>J. Adolescent Res</source><year>2006</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>215</fpage><lpage>243</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b14-ijerph-06-00036"><label>14.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kutlu</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Marakoglu</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>&#x000dc;niversite &#x000f6;&#x0011f;rencilerinde sigara birakma sikli&#x0011f;i ve davrani&#x0015f; &#x000f6;zelliklerinin de&#x0011f;erlendirilmesi</article-title><source>Marmara Med. J</source><year>2005</year><volume>18</volume><fpage>17</fpage><lpage>23</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b15-ijerph-06-00036"><label>15.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Waters</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Harris</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Hall</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Nazir</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Waigandt</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Characteristics of social smoking among college students</article-title><source>J. Am. Col. Health</source><year>2006</year><volume>55</volume><fpage>133</fpage><lpage>139</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b16-ijerph-06-00036"><label>16.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Oksuz</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Mutlu</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Malhan</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Characteristics of daily and occasional smoking among youths</article-title><source>Public Health</source><year>2007</year><volume>121</volume><fpage>349</fpage><lpage>356</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17337284</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b17-ijerph-06-00036"><label>17.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Maziak</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Mzayek</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Characterization of the smoking habit among high school students in Syria</article-title><source>Eur. J. Epidemiol</source><year>2000</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>1169</fpage><lpage>1176</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11484808</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b18-ijerph-06-00036"><label>18.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Powell</surname><given-names>LM</given-names></name><name><surname>Tauras</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Ross</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The importance of peer effects, cigarette prices and tobacco control policies for youth smoking behavior</article-title><source>J. Health Econ</source><year>2005</year><volume>24</volume><fpage>950</fpage><lpage>968</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15990184</pub-id></citation></r